<title>USA: Alcoa names Richard Kelson CFO.</title>
<headline>Alcoa names Richard Kelson CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aluminum Co of America said Tuesday Richard B. Kelson, 50, is named executive vice president and chief financial officer of Alcoa.</p>
<p>He had been executive vice president - environment, health and safety and general counsel for the corporation.</p>
<p>The company said Kelson succeeds Jan H. M. Hommen, who resigned from Alcoa earlier this year.</p>
<p>Kelson joined Alcoa as an attorney in 1974.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
